  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Agricultural Livelihoods and Employment through Investment in Land Reclamation and Water Reservoirs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention will ensure that agriculture area is expanded, soil and water conservation in mountainous slopes is secured, leading to increased production that will boost local economy and improve food security for 1 000 vulnerable farmers (200 women and 800 men), and generate unskilled labour for host communities and displaced Syrians for the value of USD 1.0 to 1.5 million.</narrative>
  </description>
